     3565       run prdoclib-init-temp-prt-obj in this-procedure
     3566         (input p-obj-type
     3567         ,input p-obj-code
     3568         ,input p-artic
     3569         ,input p-prod-type
     3570         ,input p-prod-code
     3571         ,input v-price-sale
